'''Banker Barry''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. They manage the [[Bank|Banking System]], allowing the player to deposit and withdraw {{coins}}, along with looking at previous transactions.

== Interface ==
{{:Bank/UI}}

== Banking System ==
{{Main|Bank}}
Right-clicking '''Banker Barry''' will open the {{zone|Bank}} interface. The player will be presented with several options, consisting of the ability to deposit and withdraw {{c}}, viewing previous [[Bank|Banking]] activity, and upgrading the [[Bank]] account.

{{C|alt=Coins}} stored in the Bank are not lost when the player [[Death|dies]].

=== Bank Upgrades ===
Players are able to upgrade their bank account with {{C}} and {{Item|Enchanted Gold Block}}s after meeting the respective requirement in the [[Gold]] Collection. Upgrading the [[Bank]] account increases the maximum amount of {{C}} able to be stored in the bank, and increases the maximum interest able to be gained. Upgrading Bank accounts also rewards {{SkyBlock Experience}}.

At least {{C|10m}} must be stored in the bank and the purse combined before the upgrade screen is unlocked.

== Trivia ==
*Interacting with '''Banker Barry''' will reset the player's [[Personal Bank]] cooldown, if the player has one.

